%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f1c09a7d2c7b4e5aa6d915e1274b8c01, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstContactNarrativeSettings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoodleDiplomacy.Gameplay.FirstContact.FirstContactNarrativeSettings
  narrativeScenario: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0b69c3fbbd2ce942aeac9dc289e7b18, type: 2}
  enableEncounterOpening: 1
  playPlaceholderIntroMontage: 1
  createPlaceholderGeometry: 1
  enablePreflightTutorial: 1
  placeholderIntroCardSeconds: 0.9
  delegationEntranceSeconds: 1.8
  delegationEntranceDistance: 1.75
  firstTransmissionMonitorSeconds: 1.1
  repeatedTransmissionMonitorSeconds: 0.35
  firstAlienReactionSeconds: 3
  repeatedAlienReactionSeconds: 2
  categoryCalibrationReactionSeconds: 0.9
  translationSignalSeconds: 1.35
  cues:
  - cue: 0
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.delegation_arrival
    textFallback: The delegation is in position. The terminal will record their response.
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    waitForAdvance: 0
  - cue: 1
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_category
    textFallback: We will begin with {category}. Select the terminal when you are
      ready.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 2
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_drawing
    textFallback: Draw one concrete object in the {category} category. One object
      only.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 3
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_label
    textFallback: Enter the name of the object. The machine needs the label to compare
      the signal.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 4
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.first_trace
    textFallback: One response trace recorded. Different objects in the same category
      should reveal a shared response pattern.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 5
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.more_samples
    textFallback: Good. We need {remaining} more different sample to stabilize the
      response pattern.
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    waitForAdvance: 0
  - cue: 6
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.category_calibrated
    textFallback: The {category} response pattern is stable. Calibration is complete.
    minimumSeconds: 1.2
    waitForAdvance: 0
  - cue: 7
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.bootstrap_calibrated
    textFallback: All {count} categories are calibrated. Let us see whether it can
      translate a new signal.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 8
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.translation_succeeded
    textFallback: It worked. Known categories are translating automatically; the
      unfamiliar part remains unresolved.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 9
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_intro
    textFallback: Before they arrive, I need to see whether you can produce a usable
      visual probe.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 10
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_tools
    textFallback: The three illuminated controls are the brush, fill, and eraser.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 11
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_style
    textFallback: These buttons change line width. Use the slider beside them to
      choose a color.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 12
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.tablet_history_and_send
    textFallback: Use these to undo, redo, or clear the canvas. When the drawing
      is ready, press Enter.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 13
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_drawing
    textFallback: Draw any one concrete object you like. No words, symbols, scenes,
      or extra objects.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  - cue: 14
    dialogueSequence: {fileID: 0}
    speakerLocalizationKey: speaker.doctor_hwang
    speakerFallback: Dr. Hwang
    textLocalizationKey: first_contact.narrative.preflight_passed
    textFallback: Good enough. We have seen what we need; the practice sample will
      not be recorded.
    minimumSeconds: 0.3
    waitForAdvance: 1
  translationDemoSegments:
  - categoryId: danger
    rawSignal: '[KRR]'
    meaningFallback: DANGER
  - categoryId: food
    rawSignal: '[THA]'
    meaningFallback: FOOD
  - categoryId: intent
    rawSignal: '[VOR]'
    meaningFallback: INTENT
  - categoryId: protection
    rawSignal: '[QEL]'
    meaningFallback: PROTECTION
  - categoryId: tool
    rawSignal: '[NAA]'
    meaningFallback: TOOL
